msgid "检测过滤"
msgstr "detection filter"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/detection_filter.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/detection_filter.rst:9
msgid "检测过滤节点用于根据指定条件对检测结果进行筛选，保留符合条件的检测框，过滤掉不符合要求的检测结果。"
msgstr ""
"The detection filter node is used to filter detection results according to "
"specified conditions, retain detection boxes that meet the conditions, and "
"filter out detection results that do not meet the requirements."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/detection_filter.rst:11
msgid "该节点支持多种过滤维度，包括："
msgstr "This node supports multiple filtering dimensions, including:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/detection_filter.rst:13
msgid "**类别与置信度**：基于检测类别名称、属性名称或置信度进行过滤"
msgstr ""
"**Category and Confidence**: Filter based on detection category name, "
"attribute name or confidence level"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/detection_filter.rst:14
msgid "**检测尺寸**：基于检测框的宽度、高度或面积进行过滤"
msgstr ""
"**Detection size**: Filter based on the width, height or area of ​​the "
"detection frame"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/detection_filter.rst:15
msgid "**区域**：基于检测框与指定区域的位置关系进行过滤"
msgstr ""
"**Area**: Filter based on the positional relationship between the detection "
"frame and the specified area"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/detection_filter.rst:16
msgid "**父级检测**：基于父级检测框的存在性进行过滤"
msgstr ""
"**Parent Detection**: Filter based on the existence of the parent detection "
"frame"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/logic_processor/detection_filter.rst:18
msgid "该节点常用于去除低置信度检测、筛选特定类别、过滤尺寸异常的检测框等场景，是工作流中重要的数据预处理节点。"
msgstr ""
"This node is often used in scenarios such as removing low-confidence "
"detections, filtering specific categories, and filtering detection frames "
"with abnormal sizes. It is an important data preprocessing node in the "
"workflow."

